title: "ARAKNO-AI: Advanced Research and Knowledge Architecture for Novel Organism-inspired Biomedical Research"
abstract: "A local-first, privacy-focused computational biology and scientific research platform combining PubMed literature exploration, UniProt/AlphaFold 3D structure analysis, and agentic research workflows across spinal biomechanics, bone regeneration, and biomaterials."
